  // ── Product manual (documentation chapters) ──────────────────────────────
  // A docs-style section with a contents sidebar. Each chapter renders as a
  // numbered card with a title and body text. Add/remove chapters like m1, m2…
  // (body is a single string — use the settings panel or a JSON import if you
  // want real paragraph breaks).
  manual
    heading = Product manual
    description = A guided walkthrough of the product — from first log-in to everyday workflows, admin and support.
    chapters
      m1
        title = Getting started
        body = Create your account, invite teammates, and complete your first project from template to launch in under an hour.
      m2
        title = Installation & setup
        body = Guided onboarding covers roles, integrations and branding, with step-by-step migration guides that make switching from your existing tools painless.
      m3
        title = Everyday workflows
        body = Build, review and ship from one workspace. Dashboards, notifications and automations keep the whole team aligned.
      m4
        title = Admin, billing & support
        body = Manage users and permissions, review usage and invoices, and reach our 24/7 support team from the help center.

  // ── FAQ accordion ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  faq
    q1
      question = How long does it take to get started?
      answer = Most teams are up and running within a day. Guided onboarding covers setup, team invites, and integration with your existing tools.
    q2
      question = Can we use our existing tools and data?
      answer = Yes. Migration guides and adapters cover the most common tools and formats, and our team can assist with custom integrations.
    q3
      question = Is our data secure?
      answer = Data is encrypted in transit and at rest, access is role-based and audited, and deployments run in regions of your choice.
    q4
      question = What does it cost?
      answer = Pricing scales with your team and usage. Contact us for a tailored quote — most teams start small and grow with the platform.
    q5
      question = What kind of support do we get?
      answer = Every plan includes access to documentation and community support. Priority plans add a 24/7 support line with guaranteed response times.

